      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Preparation | prepare_data.py",
      "items": [
        "Local source path, revision and SHA-256 checked. No downloads or cleaning.",
        "Content-hash order; val split uses hash mod 11 = 0, not an exact 90/10 quota.",
        "Manifest written last; normalized float32 image patches stored separately."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Packing | dataset.py",
      "items": [
        "SQLite document index; mmap uint16 \u2192 int64 inputs and shifted labels.",
        "Boundary/image/padding targets: -100. Images never split.",
        "Resume binds manifest/config and exact position. No workers or automatic repeat."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Production is still pending",
      "items": [
        "Production preflight requires 20B train text, 2B val text and 2B train image-text tokens.",
        "Stage 2 selects text only and requires \u226530% long documents at the configured context.",
